00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:19.186 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les premiers pas, les premiers

00:00:16.684 --> 00:00:20.521 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sourires, les premiers mots.

00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:22.056 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dememements précieux

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:23.591 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec sa fille Ariadne

00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:27.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que savoure Sarah Onyango,

00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:27.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car la vie d'un enfant,

00:00:23.691 --> 00:00:27.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle le sait, est fre.e.e.

00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:46.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:47.648 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Alors, Sarah ne rate aucun

00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:49.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rendez-vous à la clinique,

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:50.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et veille à ce que sa fille ait

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:51.519 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tous les vaccinsninininibles.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et s'il est une chose qu'elle

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:53.954 size:53% position:73% line:53%
craint par-dessus tout, c'est le

00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:55.222 size:53% position:73% line:53%
paludisme, aussi appelé malaria.

00:00:52.853 --> 00:00:56.557 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Selon l'OMS, la maladie tue plus

00:00:54.021 --> 00:00:57.958 size:53% position:73% line:53%
00000000 000 personnes chaque

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.360 size:53% position:73% line:53%
année; en très grande majorité

00:00:56.657 --> 00:01:08.102 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des enfants africains de moins

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:08.102 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de 5 ans. Une vie fauchée

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:08.102 size:53% position:73% line:53%
toutes les deux minutes.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:27.121 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Heureusement, un nouveau vaccin

00:01:24.485 --> 00:01:28.255 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contre la malaria vient d'être

00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:29.790 size:53% position:73% line:53%
approuvé par l'Organisation

00:01:27.221 --> 00:01:30.891 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mondiale de la santé.

00:01:28.355 --> 00:01:32.026 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(pleurs de bébé)

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:34.328 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dans cetququququque,

00:01:30.991 --> 00:01:34.328 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il est maintenant prescrit

00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:34.328 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à tous les nourrissons.

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:44.772 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ce vaccin appelé RTS-S ou

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.906 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mosquirix est un développement

00:01:43.771 --> 00:01:47.007 size:53% position:73% line:53%
majeur dans la lutte

00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:48.008 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contre la malaria.

00:01:46.006 --> 00:01:48.042 size:53% position:73% line:53%
L'aboutissement de 30 ans

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.075 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'efforts de la part de

00:01:48.242 --> 00:02:03.924 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chercheurs comme le professeur

00:01:49.343 --> 00:02:03.924 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Simon Kariuki.

00:02:06.427 --> 00:02:09.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:02:25.779 --> 00:02:29.016 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le professeur Kariuki

00:02:26.881 --> 00:02:33.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a consacré sa vie à la lutte

00:02:27.982 --> 00:02:33.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contre le paludisme.

00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:33.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais le développement du vaccin.

00:02:43.931 --> 00:02:47.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Premier écueil : la recherche

00:02:45.032 --> 00:02:49.203 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contre la malaria a longtemps

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:49.203 size:53% position:73% line:53%
souffert d'un manque de

00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:49.203 size:53% position:73% line:53%
financement.

00:03:00.581 --> 00:03:03.784 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais surtout, le parasite qui

00:03:01.682 --> 00:03:09.623 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cause la maladie, transmis par

00:03:02.783 --> 00:03:09.623 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des piqûres de moustique, s'est

00:03:03.884 --> 00:03:09.623 size:53% position:73% line:53%
révélé un adversaire redoutable.

00:03:34.248 --> 00:03:37.484 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le vaccin Mosquirix offre

00:03:35.349 --> 00:03:40.554 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une efficacité d'environ 40 %

00:03:36.483 --> 00:03:40.554 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contre la malaria.

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:40.554 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais ce n'est là qu'un début.

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:50.431 size:53% position:73% line:53%
D'autres vaccins comme le R21,

00:03:48.329 --> 00:03:51.532 size:53% position:73% line:53%
actuellement testés, s'annoncent

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:52.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
beaucoup plus efficaces.

00:03:50.531 --> 00:03:53.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et un traitement basé sur

00:03:51.632 --> 00:03:54.868 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des anticorps monoclonaux semble

00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:56.003 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lui aussi très prometteur.

00:03:53.867 --> 00:03:58.005 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Des pas de géant, franchis

00:03:54.969 --> 00:04:02.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au cours des dernières années

00:03:56.103 --> 00:04:02.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui permettent enfin

00:03:58.105 --> 00:04:02.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'être optimiste.

00:04:12.486 --> 00:04:16.056 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais d'ici là, Sarah

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:17.257 size:53% position:73% line:53%
va continuer à draîner l'eau

00:04:14.922 --> 00:04:18.625 size:53% position:73% line:53%
stagnante sur son terrain,

00:04:16.156 --> 00:04:20.027 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à utiliser les insecticides,

00:04:17.358 --> 00:04:21.595 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et surtout à dormir sous

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:29.269 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une moustiquaire, meilleur moyen

00:04:20.127 --> 00:04:29.269 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour protéger celle qu'elle

00:04:21.695 --> 00:04:29.269 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surnomme sa petite reine.

00:04:38.846 --> 00:04:38.946 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ 

